    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34492" root="فلح" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ مُتَفَلِّحُ الشَّفَةِ</span></b> , and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اليَدَيْنِ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">القَدَمَيْنِ</span>,
<i>A man having the lip chapped,</i> or <i>cracked, much,
by cold,</i> and so <i>the hands,</i> and <i>the feet.</i> (L.) [See
also 5 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فلج</span>.]

